#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:7
#: 5386ad330298411fa7d40f08910f6521
msgid "Sensor Position Offset Compensation"
msgstr "传感器位置偏移补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:9
#: fedce810b885476c8997a5917da1f44d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes compensation for sensor placement on the vehicle.  This "
"page clarifies what parameters can be set and how they should be set."
msgstr "ArduPilot包含对飞行器上传感器安装位置的补偿。本页说明可以设置哪些参数以及如何设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:13
#: e081a8c7f5e74ab0927cdf2225729f91
msgid ""
"In most vehicles which have all their sensors (IMU, GPS, optical flow, etc) "
"within 15cm of each other, it is unlikely that providing the offsets will "
"provide a noticeable performance improvement."
msgstr "在大多数飞行器中，如果所有传感器（IMU、GPS、光流等）相互之间的距离在15cm以内，提供偏移量不太可能带来明显的性能改善。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:17
#: 4fd9a8fd7a0a48468a651c3eb61ee6c0
msgid ""
"The sensor's position offsets are specified as 3 values (X, Y and Z) which "
"are distances in meters from the IMU (which can be assumed to be in the "
"middle of the autopilot board) or the vehicle's center of gravity."
msgstr "传感器的位置偏移以三个值（X、Y和Z）指定，表示距IMU（可假设位于飞控板中心）或飞行器重心的距离（单位：米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:19
#: 4630301b23824c4b8790f2fe953f69b2
msgid ""
"X : distance forward of the IMU or center of gravity.  Positive values are "
"towards the front of the vehicle, negative values are towards the back."
msgstr "X：IMU或重心前方的距离。正值表示朝向飞行器前方，负值表示朝向后方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:20
#: 339e7dd8fb044bce99a339b610f733b4
msgid ""
"Y : distance to the right of the IMU or center of gravity.  Positive values "
"are towards the right side of the vehicle, negative values are towards the "
"left."
msgstr "Y：IMU或重心右侧的距离。正值表示朝向飞行器右侧，负值表示朝向左侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:21
#: 221b55d6b7d442839b36272b751577e5
msgid ""
"Z : distance *below* the IMU or center of gravity.  Positive values are "
"*lower*, negative values are *higher*."
msgstr "Z：IMU或重心 *下方* 的距离。正值表示 *更低*，负值表示 *更高*。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:23
#: 7f5798a21ab04b66b03f0aa45c99efeb
msgid ""
"In practice the distance to the sensor can be measured from the center of "
"the autopilot unless the autopilot itself is placed a significant distance "
"from the vehicle's center of gravity in which case the IMU position offsets "
"can be specified and then the other sensor's position offsets can be "
"specified from the vehicle's center of gravity."
msgstr ""
"实际操作中，传感器距离可以从飞控中心测量，除非飞控本身距飞行器重心有相当大的距离，此时可以指定IMU位置偏移，然后其他传感器的位置偏移可以相对飞行器重心来指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:27
#: a0391bc8be964eacb1e75405d557e14c
msgid "Parameter Details"
msgstr "参数详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:29
#: 653336adb6fd4be6bd161f4114bd4e2b
msgid "**IMU (aka INS):**"
msgstr "**IMU（即INS）：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:31
#: 69e4af71f45e42068c047a3129299a60
msgid ""
"For the best results the autopilot (and thus the IMUs) should be placed at "
"the center-of-gravity of the vehicle but if this is physically impossible "
"the offset can be partially compensated for by setting the following "
"parameters."
msgstr "为获得最佳效果，飞控（及其IMU）应放置在飞行器的重心处，但如果在物理上不可能，可以通过设置以下参数对偏移进行部分补偿。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:33
#: a65ad7bb130044eab3bcfa0368b9de86
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_POS1_X <INS_POS1_X>`, :ref:`INS_POS1_Y <INS_POS1_Y>`, "
":ref:`INS_POS1_Z <INS_POS1_Z>` the first IMU's position from the vehicle's "
"center-of-gravity"
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_POS1_X <INS_POS1_X>`、:ref:`INS_POS1_Y "
"<INS_POS1_Y>`、:ref:`INS_POS1_Z <INS_POS1_Z>` 第一个IMU相对飞行器重心的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:34
#: de27ec6ddfda418da8b839c9bbbec93a
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_POS2_X <INS_POS2_X>`, :ref:`INS_POS2_Y <INS_POS2_Y>`, "
":ref:`INS_POS2_Z <INS_POS2_Z>` the second IMU's position from the vehicle's "
"center-of-gravity"
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_POS2_X <INS_POS2_X>`、:ref:`INS_POS2_Y "
"<INS_POS2_Y>`、:ref:`INS_POS2_Z <INS_POS2_Z>` 第二个IMU相对飞行器重心的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:35
#: b36e56faa072450797f5d4a5bf9dba8c
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_POS3_X <INS_POS3_X>`, :ref:`INS_POS3_Y <INS_POS3_Y>`, "
":ref:`INS_POS3_Z <INS_POS3_Z>` the third IMU's position from the vehicle's "
"center-of-gravity"
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_POS3_X <INS_POS3_X>`、:ref:`INS_POS3_Y "
"<INS_POS3_Y>`、:ref:`INS_POS3_Z <INS_POS3_Z>` 第三个IMU相对飞行器重心的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:37
#: 062ab5f9648741858aa322bafa9527a3
msgid ""
"The compensation is only *partial* because ArduPilot can correct the "
"vehicle's velocity and position estimate but it does not correct the "
"acceleration estimate. For example if the autopilot was placed on the nose "
"of a vehicle and the vehicle suddenly leans back (i.e. rotates so that its "
"nose points up) with no offset compensation the vehicle velocity estimate "
"would momentarily show the vehicle is climbing when it's not.  With the "
"position offsets added the velocity would not show this momentary climb.  "
"The EKF would still show a momentary vertical acceleration and because we "
"use the acceleration in our altitude hold controllers this could still lead "
"to the vehicle momentary reducing throttle."
msgstr ""
"该补偿仅是 *部分* "
"的，因为ArduPilot可以校正飞行器的速度和位置估计，但不能校正加速度估计。例如，如果飞控安装在飞行器机头，当飞行器突然向后倾斜（即旋转使机头朝上）时，没有偏移补偿的情况下，飞行器速度估计会暂时显示飞行器在爬升（实际上没有）。加入位置偏移后，速度将不显示这种瞬时爬升。EKF仍会显示瞬时垂直加速度，由于我们在高度保持控制器中使用加速度，这仍可能导致飞行器暂时减小油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:42
#: 61b0f5b92e22452193afb979df7326e9
msgid ""
"Although individual position offsets can be set for each IMU, the difference"
" between the placement of IMUs on most autopilot boards is so small that the"
" same values can be used for all IMUs"
msgstr "虽然可以为每个IMU设置单独的位置偏移，但大多数飞控板上IMU之间的距离如此之小，以至于所有IMU可以使用相同的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-offset-compensation.rst:44
#: 04da7be144694a99a94f12c4a7ffe9eb
msgid ""
"if the IMU offset is specified, then all the following offsets are relative "
"to **Center of Gravity** rather than the IMU."
msgstr "如果指定了IMU偏移，则以下所有偏移均相对于 **重心** 而非IMU。"

